p('Trip setup: select the initial destination before driving. I1 supplies the current location, so manual origin selection is not required.')
p('Privacy: raw audio is excluded from logs, telemetry, temporary files, and usage summaries.')
p('D1 follow-up: finalize audio encoding and provider-specific wire details. This D0 defines the named fields and error responsibilities.')
