(P/'README.md').write_text('''# Veer Design D0\n\nTeam: Grady Algire, Brady Cooper, Briar Elliot, Dominic Rowland, Aiden Ward.\nAdvisor: Dr. Jillian Aurisano.\n\n- D0_High_Level_Design.pdf: D0 submission document.\n- D0_High_Level_Design.docx: editable document source.\n- D0_Block_Diagram.drawio, D0_Data_Flow.drawio, and D0_Usage_Flow.drawio: editable diagrams.net files.\n- PNG figures match the PDF.\n- build_sources.py: reproducible document/diagram generator (requires python-docx and Pillow; DejaVu Sans font). Run from repository root.\n\nApproval policy is confirmed: explicit spoken okay is required; activate the approved route within 3 seconds after okay ends. Silence leaves the route unchanged. D1 and D2 can sit beside this document.\n\nFrom the team repository root:\n```sh\ngit add Design_Diagrams\ngit commit -m "Add Veer D0 architecture and editable sources"\n```\nThe repository was not supplied, so no commit has been performed.\n''')
